ZCL_MODULE_CAPABILITY("tools/command/native_dev_land_speculative.c", CAP_FS_READ|CAP_FS_WRITE, "makes one private scratch directory under the OS temp directory holding a detached git worktree and removes both again, and removes the scratch directories (prefix z23-land-spec-, owned by this user, older than 20 minutes) and their registered worktrees a crashed earlier call left; its git commits are unsigned unreferenced objects in the landing repository; writes the --bundle_out bundle and its offer only through the send leaf's exclusive-create helper; every git child goes through the spawn seam with an argv and no shell; the queue file is read through the land leaf's loader and never written")
